label story_05_fail (The Door Beneath Veld Failed)
[style name="Gameplay"]
"Dianthus Core" (Default): The door beneath Veld widens. I can feel it in my roots like a wound that will not close. The dark has learned our scent.
"Dianthus Core": I will not lie to you, little alchemist. The garden's future has narrowed to a single stubborn thread.
"Dianthus Core": But even a narrow path can carry a living root. Hold the line. Tend what remains. Let every day we steal from the dark matter — because each one is a seed the hunger failed to swallow.
[signal arg="quest_start:story_alt_shadow_loss"]
[end_timeline]
